      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agreed. DLSS is like magic and, for me, it made Cyan Worlds' recent remake of Myst playable in VR instead of a slideshow.\nIn their latest Developer Update (https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-29-july-2022/10900), they explained that they're unsatisfied with the quality of the results observed during their testing of FSR. DLSS doesn't suffer from those problems and is a vastly superior solution to FSR 1.0. Furthermore, according to the Steam Hardware Survey, 75% of users have NVIDIA graphics cards so I think DLSS should be prioritised. Alternatively, they should use FSR 2.0.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
